{"id":167909820776543,"type":"artist","name":"Cathedral","artist":null,"year":1989,"weight":15,"info":{"country":"GB","begin":"1989","end":"2013","kind":"Group","similar":["Saint Vitus","The Obsessed","Reverend Bizarre","Trouble","Goatsnake","Witchfinder General","Pentagram","Church of Misery","Candlemass","Electric Wizard"],"disambiguation":"British doom metal band","img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/f2db814506e5121fbfa404fb4bd42dbc/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Hay, al menos, tres grupos con el nombre de Cathedral:\n\n1. Cathedral, banda de Symphonic Prog, fundada en Long Island (Estados Unidos de Amárica), en 1975.\n\n2. Cathedral, banda de Neo-Prog, fundada en Estados Unidos de América en el año 1991.\n\n3. Cathedral, banda inglesa de Doom Metal:\n\nCathedral es una banda de Doom Metal formada en Coventry, Inglaterra. Fué fundada por Lee Dorrian, Mark 'Griff' Griffiths, y Garry 'Gaz' Jennings en 1989. Cathedral creó un lazo entre el primer Doom Metal (Black Sabbath","tags":["doom metal","stoner metal","Stoner Rock","Doom","metal"]},"works":[{"id":262854703180409,"type":"album","name":"Stained Glass Stories","artist":"Cathedral","year":1978,"weight":3,"yt":"m81I0bk1P8o","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":229542227465836,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Symphonic Prog","rank":113,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":59388003826898,"type":"album","name":"Forest Of Equilibrium","artist":"Cathedral","year":1991,"weight":17,"yt":"EZkufellkew","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":222945056519976,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1991","rank":146,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":512,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":68519467142167,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Doom Metal","rank":114,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":143845860985120,"type":"album","name":"The Ethereal Mirror","artist":"Cat